SUMMARY:CNIB GTA Hub
CLASS:PUBLIC
STATUS:CONFIRMED
LOCATION:CNIB GTA Community Hub – 1525 Yonge St\, Toronto\, ON M4T 1Z2\, 
 Canada
DESCRIPTION:The Repair Café at the CNIB GTA Community Hub runs from 11 AM 
 to 2 PM. The primary focus of this event is on repairing accessibility dev
 ices such as Perkins braillers\, white canes\, electronic magnifiers\, t
 alking and braille watches\, and sewing-related repairs. The Repair Café 
 does not charge for repairs\, it is free! We encourage individuals to RSVP
  in advance to secure priority for repairs\, although walk-ins are also we
 lcome. While the event primarily serves the blind and visually impaired co
 mmunity\, we may accommodate individuals outside of this community based o
 n availability and foot traffic. For further details or inquiries\, please
  feel free to contact Dom at Dom.Chan@cnib.ca. Please note that this buil
 ding\, the CNIB GTA Hub on Yonge St.\, will be demolished in July 2026. Fu
 ture CNIB Repair Café events will be at the CNIB building at 1929 Bayview
  Ave\, a few blocks north of Eglinton Ave.
GEO:43.6897795;-79.3946212
CATEGORIES:Midi Event
URL:https://repaircafetoronto.ca/rc-events/cnib-gta-hub-4/
END:VEVENT
